⚡ Why Use Loguru?
- Zero configuration → You can start logging immediately with logger.info("message").
- Beautiful formatting → Logs are colorized and structured for readability.
- Rotation & Retention → Automatically split logs into files and clean up old ones.
- Serialization → Export logs as JSON for integration with monitoring tools.
- Exception handling → Catch and log uncaught exceptions with full tracebacks.

------------------------
Logging with loguru:-

from loguru import logger

# Simple log
logger.info("Starting the application...")

# Different levels
logger.debug("Debugging details")
logger.warning("This is a warning")
logger.error("An error occurred")

# Logging to a file with rotation
logger.add("app.log", rotation="1 MB", retention="7 days")
logger.info("This will also be written to app.log")
